# Web console configuration. Copy to .env.local for local overrides (it is git-ignored).
#
# Every VITE_ variable is compiled into the JavaScript bundle and is readable by anyone who
# opens the console. Only PUBLIC values belong here:
#   - the API base URL
#   - the Supabase project URL and the Supabase publishable key (Phase 2, sign-in only)
# Never put the Anthropic API key, the Supabase secret / service_role key, a database
# password, or any connector credential in this file or in any VITE_ variable.

# Base URL of the LightHouse API. Leave unset to use "/api" on the same origin (production)
# or through the Vite dev proxy to http://127.0.0.1:8000 (development).
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api

# Phase 2 placeholders. Not read by the console yet.
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=your-publishable-key
